{{Term/Store|Hylian Rice|Hylian Rice|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Hylian Rice can be found by cutting grass in [[East Necluda]]. It is also sold by establishments like the [[Coral Reef]], the [[East Wind]], the [[General Shoppe]], and [[The Slippery Falcon]] and the [[Traveling Merchant]] [[Yammo]]. Eating it restores one of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s. After completing the [[Side Quest]] "[[Curry for What Ails You]]", Link can give [[Lester]] [[Goron Spice]] at any time to receive Hylian Rice. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Hylian Rice can be used to make [[White Dye]].

When [[Cooking]] in a [[Cooking Pot]], Hylian Rice is required to make [[Crab Risotto]], a [[Crab Omelet with Rice]], [[Curry Pilaf]], [[Curry Rice]], [[Fried Egg and Rice]], a [[Gourmet Meat and Rice Bowl]], [[Gourmet Meat Curry]], [[Gourmet Poultry Curry]], [[Gourmet Poultry Pilaf]], a [[Meat and Rice Bowl]], [[Meat Curry]], [[Meaty Rice Balls]], [[Monster Curry]], [[Monster Rice Balls]], [[Mushroom Rice Balls]], [[Mushroom Risotto]], [[Poultry Curry]], [[Poultry Pilaf]], a [[Prime Meat and Rice Bowl]], [[Prime Meat Curry]], [[Prime Poultry Curry]], [[Prime Poultry Pilaf]], [[Salmon Risotto]], [[Seafood Curry]], [[Seafood Fried Rice]], [[Seafood Paella]], [[Seafood Rice Balls]], [[Vegetable Curry]], [[Vegetable Risotto]], and [[Veggie Rice Balls]].

